    <item>
      <title>PvZ2 Reflourished 1.5.6 for Windows</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:51:14 +0000</pubDate>
      <link>https://github.com/oenderg/Reflourished-Darwin/releases/tag/v1.5.6</link>
      <sparkle:version>10506</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Reflourished 1.5.6.</b> Smoother menus on Intel and AMD PCs.</p><ul><li>Windows (Intel and AMD PCs): the Select your Seeds screen no longer stutters while you scroll it.</li><li>Windows (Intel and AMD PCs): the News and Updates page no longer drops to about 40 fps; it now runs as smoothly as the rest of the game.</li><li>Windows (Intel and AMD PCs): after updating, the game gets itself ready for your PC once more on the first start.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/oenderg/Reflourished-Darwin/releases/tag/v1.5.6">The release on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
